tic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578400/extras/7d58a32ce07cd8008404c6554d2e3c2a.webm?t=1753384156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcd6 True Bible Immersion:</strong> Every question is carefully organized by book, offering an unprecedented educational and spiritual journey through the Bible.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd4a <strong>Start your biblical adventure today.</strong> Bible Trivia is more than just a game \u2014 it's a doorway to spiritual discovery. Explore the beauty and wisdom of the Bible like never before.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578400/extras/1513c2341dce6e5e1959ab59ad2729ca.poster.avif?t=1753384156\" width=610 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578400/extras/1513c2341dce6e5e1959ab59ad2729ca.webm?t=1753384156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>",
